-- German translations for the full current EviPrev-reconciled catalog (40
-- items): cadence_label, why_it_matters, and recommendation_text, preserving
-- each item's clinical meaning (cadence bands, risk-gating language,
-- shared-decision-making phrasing) rather than a loose paraphrase. Band-level
-- cadence overrides remain English-only (a known, documented gap from the
-- i18n foundation work) — this only translates the item-level base fields
-- that preventive_catalog_item_translations covers.

on conflict (item_id, locale) do update set
  cadence_label = excluded.cadence_label,
  why_it_matters = excluded.why_it_matters,
  recommendation_text = excluded.recommendation_text,
  updated_at = now();
